  {
   "id": "cb_a8068aa1acf3cf1d808814eb",
   "order": 9,
   "title_en": "FAQ",
   "body_en": "1.Accessory Compatibility\nNot compatible with Cool Plate SuperTack and AMS lite.\n\n2.Drying Recommendations\nAs this filament is highly moisture-absorbent, please place any unused filament in a sealed container with desiccant immediately, and dry thoroughly before printing. For more details, please refer to: Filament drying instructions on WIKI.\n\n3.Safety Tips\nThe nozzle temperature should be between 260-280°C, and the heat bed temperature should be between 90-110°C. Please ensure safety during printing.\nPlease store the filament in a cool, dark, and dry environment away from direct sunlight and high temperatures.\nPlease keep filament and any broken fragments out of reach of infants, children, and pets to prevent swallowing or choking.\nPlease print this filament in a well-ventilated area, or install an effective air filtration or exhaust system.\nAs this filament is not food-grade, please avoid using finished prints for food storage or contact.",
   "url": "",
   "source_media_id": "",
   "source_url": "",
   "alt_en": "",
   "alt_ar": "",
   "alt_ckb": "",
   "kind": "text",
   "section_kind": "faq",
   "section_path": "components[4]"
  },
  {
   "id": "cb_ee81a10f7913760c2c24588d",
   "order": 10,
   "title_en": "Highlights",
   "body_en": "• UL 94-2023 V-0 Flame Retardancy\n• Engineering-Level Mechanical Properties\n• Comes with High Temperature Reusable Spool\n• Dry Out Before Use\n• Cautions for Use",
   "url": "",
